        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Godley, the actor who played Inspector Javert, Victoria Hill\n- Works: Les Misérables, The Caterpillar Wish\n- Awards: Laurence Olivier Award\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Godley has won the Laurence Olivier Award three times.\n- The TV series production of Les Misérables featured an actor who performed as Inspector Javert.\n- The actor who played Inspector Javert in the TV series Les Misérables also starred in the film The Caterpillar Wish.\n- The actor who played Inspector Javert in the TV series Les Misérables won the same award as Adam Godley, the Laurence Olivier Award.\n- The actor described is David Oyelowo.\n- Victoria Hill also starred in The Caterpillar Wish.",
